; ============================================================
; TITLE:    Minkowski Sausage
; CATEGORY: Fractals
; LEVEL:    Intermediate
; TAGS:     recursion, Minkowski, square wave, island
; SUMMARY:  Turns every side of a square into a zigzag of eight pieces, three times over.
; ============================================================
;
; WHAT IT DOES
;   The Minkowski rule swaps a straight line for eight lines a
;   quarter as long, stepping up and down like a castle wall. Put the
;   rule on the four sides of a square and repeat it, and you get an
;   island whose coast is twice as long at every level, while the
;   area stays the same.
;
; HOW TO USE
;   Press Run. The island at the right is level 3, the small ones on
;   the left show levels 0, 1 and 2.
;
; CONCEPTS YOU WILL LEARN
;   * a recursion with eight calls written as a word of turns
;   * running a list of commands in order with FOREACH
;   * drawing the same island several times at different sizes
;
; THINGS TO TRY
;   * Change the list of turns in WALL to make a new rule. Keep as
;     many L as R so the wall still ends up going straight.
;   * Draw only one side to see the "sausage" on its own.
;   * Fill the islands with FILLED.
; ============================================================

; WALL draws one Minkowski curve. The eight pieces are joined by the
; turns in the list: L means left 90, R means right 90, and S means
; carry straight on.
to wall :len :level
  if :level = 0 [forward :len stop]
  ; Seven turns join the eight pieces. FOREACH draws a piece and
  ; then makes the turn; the eighth piece comes after the loop.
  foreach [L R R S L L R] [
    wall :len / 4 :level - 1
    if ? = "L [left 90]
    if ? = "R [right 90]
  ]
  wall :len / 4 :level - 1
end

; ISLAND draws a square of Minkowski walls centered on (x, y).
to island :x :y :side :level :color
  penup setxy :x - :side / 2 :y - :side / 2 setheading 0 pendown
  setpencolor :color
  repeat 4 [wall :side :level right 90]
end

clearscreen hideturtle
setbackground [250 245 235]
setpensize 2
island -280 170 80 0 [200 80 60]
island -280 0 80 1 [220 140 40]
island -280 -170 80 2 [60 150 90]
setpensize 1.5
island 110 0 300 3 [40 90 180]
